A. Periodic inspections of the stormwater management system during construction shall be conducted by the staff of the city or conducted and certified by a professional engineer who has been approved by the city. Inspections shall use the approved stormwater management plan for establishing compliance. All inspections shall be documented with written reports that contain the following information:
